{"data": [{"author_id": "1216167367958355968", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:26:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120312248438849585"], "id": "2120312248438849585", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120191790774960630", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey 盲测一做模型就露馅", "url": "https://x.com/yzpq6668/status/2120312248438849585"}, {"author_id": "1411274511505408001", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:22:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120311041493966964"], "id": "2120311041493966964", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120191790774960630", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey 文中“缺数据不编”和“能发现方法缺陷”其实是两种能力。科研里更危险的是数据齐全、流程却有偏差。想看给同一份记录只改一个实验步骤的盲测：模型还能指出问题，还是只会顺着结果找解释？", "url": "https://x.com/wchengphy/status/2120311041493966964"}, {"author_id": "3178231", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:18:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120310084173451364"], "id": "2120310084173451364", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1726516523072626688", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 132, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120309364921868454", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@yao_bell62018 我的不行 https://t.co/DqERXJWnFz", "url": "https://x.com/dotey/status/2120310084173451364"}, {"author_id": "1726516523072626688", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:15:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120309364921868454"], "id": "2120309364921868454", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 126, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120191790774960630", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey pro app里能用啊 https://t.co/nl9hbcFk1x", "url": "https://x.com/yao_bell62018/status/2120309364921868454"}, {"author_id": "1891833767519715329", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:01:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120305770608959862"], "id": "2120305770608959862", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 56, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120191790774960630", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey 99.99/月订Ultra才能用Carbon，API按量付费倒是不挑人，Google把模型当SaaS卖、把用户当韭菜割", "url": "https://x.com/YunTechX/status/2120305770608959862"}, {"author_id": "4773557952", "created_at": "2026-11-10T23:43:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120301312768360763"], "id": "2120301312768360763", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 159, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120191790774960630", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey /swarm 挺有意思，但每个 agent 单独烧额度，感觉最后最忙的可能是账单监控员哈哈。", "url": "https://x.com/parkmanpcl/status/2120301312768360763"}, {"author_id": "856357866", "created_at": "2026-11-10T23:13:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120293841370784098"], "id": "2120293841370784098", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 107, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120191790774960630", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey 按字数算，Carbon 现在是 Fable 5.2 的四分之一价。但不同模型干同一件活，用的字数不一样", "url": "https://x.com/aimusheng/status/2120293841370784098"}, {"author_id": "1995879937442807810", "created_at": "2026-11-10T23:00:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120290425768690110"], "id": "2120290425768690110", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1504955609619177475", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120253367960359284", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@chaojidigua @dotey 来啦，借楼互关，关注必回！", "url": "https://x.com/ATHENAFundAnn/status/2120290425768690110"}, {"author_id": "43090999", "created_at": "2026-11-10T22:26:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120281864258949438"], "id": "2120281864258949438", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 383, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120191790774960630", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey 我用fable 5.2挺好", "url": "https://x.com/ShinChven/status/2120281864258949438"}, {"author_id": "1504955609619177475", "created_at": "2026-11-10T20:56:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120259263524380861"], "id": "2120259263524380861", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1504955609619177475", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 159, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120253127953682646", "type": "quoted"}, {"id": "2120253367960359284", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey ARC-AGI-3 评测:  Gemini 4 Carbon: 65.1%\n\n这意味着它略好于 GPT-6 Astra（60%），但远不如 Claude Fable 5.2（80%）。\nhttps://t.co/38kW7Lxpaw", "url": "https://x.com/chaojidigua/status/2120259263524380861"}, {"author_id": "1769051162169561089", "created_at": "2026-11-10T20:33:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120253528384077982"], "id": "2120253528384077982", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1504955609619177475", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 52, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120253367960359284", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@chaojidigua @dotey 谷歌的问题不是模型差一截，而是定价没拉开差距。同价位下没人选次优解，除非生态先把人锁住。", "url": "https://x.com/hajiMVP/status/2120253528384077982"}, {"author_id": "1504955609619177475", "created_at": "2026-11-10T20:32:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120253367960359284"], "id": "2120253367960359284", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 617, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120191790774960630", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey 谷歌的策略让人摸不着头脑.\n\nGemini 4 Carbon 的竞争对手是 Claude Fable 5.2.\n\n而 Claude Fable 5.2 的能力明显更强.\n\n如果价格类似, 用户当然会选择 Claude Fable.\n\n谷歌这么做, 也许是因为:\n\n1. 算力不足, 不希望太多用户使用.\n2. Gemini 4 Carbon 成本很高, 用户越多, 亏损越严重.", "url": "https://x.com/chaojidigua/status/2120253367960359284"}, {"author_id": "1452295446580416532", "created_at": "2026-11-10T17:28:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120206859600855507"], "id": "2120206859600855507", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120191790774960630", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey 这种对比我更想固定一个真实 app 的同一个 bug 验收测试也不变 把总费用 耗时和人工接管次数一起列出来 不然单价便宜很容易被多跑几轮吃回去", "url": "https://x.com/wangyan_im/status/2120206859600855507"}, {"author_id": "2095722313744601088", "created_at": "2026-11-10T17:20:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120204952614408382"], "id": "2120204952614408382", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 213, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120191790774960630", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey 按这个分工，日常用 Argon，最难的活才交给 Carbon，单为后者长期订 Ultra，确实得看这种任务有多频繁。", "url": "https://x.com/Rennix7t/status/2120204952614408382"}, {"author_id": "2110610632198516736", "created_at": "2026-11-10T17:06:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120201547854533056"], "id": "2120201547854533056", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_co